<title>LEBANON: Car accident kills nine people in Lebanon.</title>
<headline>Car accident kills nine people in Lebanon.</headline>
<dateline>TRIPOLI, Lebanon 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six Lebanese workers and three Syrians were killed on Monday in a car accident on the Lebanese-Syrian border, police said.</p>
<p>A Syrian-registered taxi and a Lebanese mini-bus full of workers collided head on in the area between the Lebanese and Syrian frontier posts north of this Lebanese city, they said.</p>
